        </div>
        <div class="stat-box">
          <span class="stat-val">0 元</span>
          <span class="stat-lbl">真·开源合规工具清单</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-box">
          <span class="stat-val">¥8/月</span>
          <span class="stat-lbl">平价专线低成本救生圈</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Table of Contents Fast-Track -->
    <section class="monograph-toc-box border-shadow">
      <div class="toc-header">
        <span class="toc-icon">📑</span>
        <h2 class="toc-title">专著章节快速导航目录</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="toc-grid">
