        <h2 class="section-h2">核心结论速览与 5 大代理方案全景横向对比大表</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="direct-answer-banner border-shadow">
        <div class="answer-header">
          <span class="answer-badge">💡 protonVPN 实验室直接判断结论</span>
          <h3 class="answer-title">免费节点能用吗？什么时候能用？什么时候绝对不要用？</h3>
        </div>
